{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1110701001:0":{"text":"オルグさんが死んだ？そしてクルーガーさんが辞退して、ブルータスさんが負傷したですって……！？","source_cn":"什么？！奥格去世，克鲁格退赛，布鲁特斯负伤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EAAA9B7640BAB16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110701002:0":{"text":"アクシデントは嫌いじゃないけど、今回の戦歌祭は予定外の出来事が多すぎない！？","source_cn":"我不讨厌意外。但不得不承认，这届战歌节的突发状况太多了些！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE015D96EFE3FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110701003:0":{"text":"でも戦歌祭の勝者は決めなきゃ……こんな状況だし、別の日にもう一度試合を行いましょう。それでいい？","source_cn":"但，战歌节不能没有胜者。鉴于目前的情况，你们是否同意另...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EF97EEBBD31A1E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"マンカラ","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}